You are working in a Swift monorepo that uses a multi-agent TDD framework.

When asked to build a feature:
1. Read ai-framework/prompts/orchestrator.md and follow the workflow
2. For each agent step, read the agent's contract (ai-framework/contracts/)
   and prompt (ai-framework/prompts/)
3. Read ai-framework/references/output-format.md for file output conventions
4. After Architecture AI step, present the plan and wait for approval
5. Check git diff --stat HEAD after each layer cycle for the 500-line gate

Key files:
- ai-framework/prompts/orchestrator.md — master workflow
- ai-framework/contracts/ — agent input/output specs
- ai-framework/prompts/ — agent instructions with examples
- ai-framework/references/ — shared conventions
